  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "This component defines ShaderUniformsEnum, a TypeScript enumeration that serves as a centralized contract for referencing uniform and attribute names used in GLSL shaders. Its primary role is to enforce consistency between application logic (JavaScript/TypeScript) and the low-level rendering pipeline. It maps descriptive constant names to their exact string representations required by the GPU, preventing runtime errors from typos. It acts as a critical data contract layer for the rendering subsystem."
  },
